；夹角改变时，该投影随之改变。"],"sections":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"definition","text":"内积既可按坐标分量定义，也可按向量长度和夹角定义；这两个定义给出相同的数。","title":"definition"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"formula","text":"\\boldsymbol a\\cdot\\boldsymbol b=a_1b_1+a_2b_2=\\lvert\\boldsymbol a\\rvert\\lvert\\boldsymbol b\\rvert\\cos\\theta","title":"formula"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"derivation","text":"将 $\\boldsymbol a$ 投影到 $\\boldsymbol b$ 的方向，投影长度为 $\\lvert\\boldsymbol a\\rvert\\cos\\theta$。\n投影长度再乘 $\\lvert\\boldsymbol b\\rvert$，得到 $\\boldsymbol a\\cdot\\boldsymbol b=\\lvert\\boldsymbol a\\rvert\\lvert\\boldsymbol b\\rvert\\cos\\theta$；将坐标轴取为正交基时，同一量为 $a_1b_1+a_2b_2$。","title":"derivation"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"worked_examples","text":"$$\\boldsymbol e_1\\cdot\\boldsymbol e_2=0=\\lvert\\boldsymbol e_1\\rvert\\lvert\\boldsymbol e_2\\rvert\\cos90^\\circ$$","title":"worked_examples"},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"geometric_meaning","text":"内积测量一个向量在另一个向量方向上的带符号分量；夹角改变时，该投影随之改变。","title":"geometric_meaning"}],"summary":"内积既可按坐标分量定义，也可按向量长度和夹角定义；这两个定义给出相同的数。","symbol_roles":{"a":"vector_a","b":"vector_b","r":"result"},"title":"内积两种定义的几何等价","worked_examples":[{"calculation":["$$\\boldsymbol e_1\\cdot\\boldsymbol e_2=0=\\lvert\\boldsymbol e_1\\rvert\\lvert\\boldsymbol e_2\\rvert\\cos90^\\circ$$"],"checks":[{"expected":0.0,"name":"dot","tolerance":1e-09}],"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"given":[[1,0],[0,1]],"id":"example.ch01.inner.equivalence","kind":"inner_product","result":0.0,"title":"案例一：正交向量"}]},"generated":{"artifact_digest":"sha256:cf365c7d7c53cbb5fb8573fa121142aeb462edf5646196c1955173af4252c560","generated_at":"2026-09-10T19:47:26Z","model":"lecture-grounded-v2","prompt_version":"teaching-artifact-v1","provider":"math-explanation-sample","raw_reply_digest":"sha256:6742ed4d5f6fb63d83b62b3ead50e44f0479c34cf676f662f01225a47a1c536c","schema_version":1,"source_hash":"sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6"},"revision":10,"schema_version":1,"source":{"excerpt":"##### 两种定义等价性的证明\n\n以下展开完整的余弦定理推导过程。\n\n证明：设 $a = (a_{1}, a_{2})$，$b = (b_{1}, b_{2})$，其夹角为 $\\theta$。\n\n考虑向量 $a - b$。由余弦定理（或三角形不等式），在三角形 OAB 中：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta \\dots ①\n$$\n\n另一方面，用代数展开左边：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = (a_{1}-b_{1})^{2} + (a_{2}-b_{2})^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= a_{1}^{2} - 2a_{1}b_{1} + b_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2} - 2a_{2}b_{2} + b_{2}^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= (a_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2}) + (b_{1}^{2} + b_{2}^{2}) - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n$$\n= |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}) \\dots ②\n$$\n\n对比 ① 和 ②：\n$$\n|a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n消去 $|a|^{2} + |b|^{2}$，两边同除以 $-2$，得：\n$$\n|a||b|\\cos\\theta = a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}\n$$\n即 几何定义 $=$ 代数定义。■\n\n推广：对 $R^{n}$，$n \\geq 3$，我们无法画出夹角 $\\theta$，但可以直接用代数定义 $a \\cdot b = \\sum a_{i}b_{i}$，然后用 Cauchy-Schwarz 不等式保证 $|a \\cdot b|/(|a||b|) \\in [-1,1]$，从而定义 $\\theta = \\arccos(\\frac{a \\cdot b}{|a||b|})$。这就是第1章末尾高维预览的核心逻辑。","heading_level":5,"heading_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.3 内积","两种定义等价性的证明"],"neighboring_titles":[],"occurrence":1,"source_hash":"sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6","source_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.3 内积","两种定义等价性的证明"],"spans":[{"end_line":291,"fingerprint":"sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6","heading_path":["第1章 向量与几何测量","1.3 内积","两种定义等价性的证明"],"id":"第1章 向量与几何测量 / 1.3 内积 / 两种定义等价性的证明::1::sha256:18371503c870b3e41027bcfb2cc9b77e7f4595fa93f1041b11f68921e280b4f6","start_line":255,"text":"##### 两种定义等价性的证明\n\n以下展开完整的余弦定理推导过程。\n\n证明：设 $a = (a_{1}, a_{2})$，$b = (b_{1}, b_{2})$，其夹角为 $\\theta$。\n\n考虑向量 $a - b$。由余弦定理（或三角形不等式），在三角形 OAB 中：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta \\dots ①\n$$\n\n另一方面，用代数展开左边：\n$$\n|a - b|^{2} = (a_{1}-b_{1})^{2} + (a_{2}-b_{2})^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= a_{1}^{2} - 2a_{1}b_{1} + b_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2} - 2a_{2}b_{2} + b_{2}^{2}\n$$\n$$\n= (a_{1}^{2} + a_{2}^{2}) + (b_{1}^{2} + b_{2}^{2}) - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n$$\n= |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}) \\dots ②\n$$\n\n对比 ① 和 ②：\n$$\n|a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2|a||b|\\cos\\theta = |a|^{2} + |b|^{2} - 2(a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2})\n$$\n消去 $|a|^{2} + |b|^{2}$，两边同除以 $-2$，得：\n$$\n|a||b|\\cos\\theta = a_{1}b_{1} + a_{2}b_{2}\n$$\n即 几何定义 $=$ 代数定义。■\n\n推广：对 $R^{n}$，$n \\geq 3$，我们无法画出夹角 $\\theta$，但可以直接用代数定义 $a \\cdot b = \\sum a_{i}b_{i}$，然后用 Cauchy-Schwarz 不等式保证 $|a \\cdot b|/(|a||b|) \\in [-1,1]$，从而定义 $\\theta = \\arccos(\\frac{a \\cdot b}{|a||b|})$。这就是第1章末尾高维预览的核心逻辑。"}]},"status":"published","teaching_profile":{"minimum_level":2,"required_sections":["definition","formula","worked_examples","geometric_meaning"],"requires_analogy_boundary":false},"topic_id":"ch01.inner.equivalence","visual_semantics":{"entities":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"dimension":2,"id":"a","kind":"vector","label":"a","role":"vector_a","value":[1,0]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"dimension":2,"id":"b","kind":"vector","label":"b","role":"vector_b","value":[0,1]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"dimension":2,"id":"r","kind":"vector","label":"result","role":"result","value":[1,0]}],"relations":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.inner.equivalence"],"id":"main_relation","kind":"compare","parameters":{},"source_ref":"a","target_ref":"r"}],"scene_kind":"2d","stages":[{"caption":"","expected_invariants":["typed calculation"],"id":"stage.main","input_entity_refs":["a","b"],"layout":"overlay","output_entity_refs":["r"],"relation_refs":["main_relation"],"title":"案例一：正交向量"}]}}}
